        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Project Chromata</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Chromata is a minimalist sci-fi idle game with a deep, unfolding mystery. You awaken as the Chroma Engine, a machine built for a single purpose: to create. In a silent, starless void, you must generate fundamental colors, combine them into increasingly complex forms, and reignite the memory of a lost cosmos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Directive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe is empty. Your function is to fill it. Allocate your power, construct an evolving resource engine, and push back against the perfect nothingness. Each restored star becomes a new light in the dark and reveals another fragment of a forgotten story, bringing you closer to understanding what was lost and why.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten Stages</strong>,<strong> </strong>and It<strong> Doesn't Stay </strong>an<strong> Idle Game,</strong> Stage 4 hands you a war across eight realms. Stage 7 gives you a terminal and nothing else. By Stage 10 you aren't trying to win, you're trying to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you want one prestige layer refined for a hundred hours, this isn't that game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you want an idle game with an ending, it is.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create &amp; Combine:</strong> Generate primary colors and unlock advanced mixers to construct an intricate production chain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reignite the Stars:</strong> Transform your creations into Light and restore a vast, explorable <strong>Star Chart</strong>. Complete constellations to unlock powerful, permanent bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate Everything:</strong> Evolve the Chroma Engine with sophisticated automation that manages production and upgrades, allowing you to focus on restoring the cosmos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the Past:</strong> Recover fragmented records from the void and uncover the truth behind the universe, your creators, and your purpose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete the Journey:</strong> Experience the complete story of Project Chromata, from the first spark of color to the final stage of the Chroma Engine’s journey.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two More Games Inside</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pixel</strong>: Survive, cultivate and automate as a living pixel in the Engine's broken circuits, if you can find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VoidCrash</strong>: Voxel automation in the void, currently an alpha playtest. Both launch from the main menu.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for joining <strong>Project Chromata</strong>. The complete game is now here, bringing its full story and progression together from beginning to end. What began as a small experiment has grown into a journey across color, Light, forgotten worlds, and the mysteries beyond the stars. I hope you enjoy uncovering everything the universe has been waiting to reveal. Your feedback and support have helped shape Project Chromata, and I am deeply grateful to everyone who has joined the journey.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Project Chromata</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Chromata is a minimalist sci-fi idle game with a deep, unfolding mystery. You awaken as the Chroma Engine, a machine built for a single purpose: to create. In a silent, starless void, you must generate fundamental colors, combine them into increasingly complex forms, and reignite the memory of a lost cosmos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Directive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe is empty. Your function is to fill it. Allocate your power, construct an evolving resource engine, and push back against the perfect nothingness. Each restored star becomes a new light in the dark and reveals another fragment of a forgotten story, bringing you closer to understanding what was lost and why.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten Stages</strong>,<strong> </strong>and It<strong> Doesn't Stay </strong>an<strong> Idle Game,</strong> Stage 4 hands you a war across eight realms. Stage 7 gives you a terminal and nothing else. By Stage 10 you aren't trying to win, you're trying to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you want one prestige layer refined for a hundred hours, this isn't that game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you want an idle game with an ending, it is.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create &amp; Combine:</strong> Generate primary colors and unlock advanced mixers to construct an intricate production chain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reignite the Stars:</strong> Transform your creations into Light and restore a vast, explorable <strong>Star Chart</strong>. Complete constellations to unlock powerful, permanent bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate Everything:</strong> Evolve the Chroma Engine with sophisticated automation that manages production and upgrades, allowing you to focus on restoring the cosmos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the Past:</strong> Recover fragmented records from the void and uncover the truth behind the universe, your creators, and your purpose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete the Journey:</strong> Experience the complete story of Project Chromata, from the first spark of color to the final stage of the Chroma Engine’s journey.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two More Games Inside</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pixel</strong>: Survive, cultivate and automate as a living pixel in the Engine's broken circuits, if you can find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VoidCrash</strong>: Voxel automation in the void, currently an alpha playtest. Both launch from the main menu.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for joining <strong>Project Chromata</strong>. The complete game is now here, bringing its full story and progression together from beginning to end. What began as a small experiment has grown into a journey across color, Light, forgotten worlds, and the mysteries beyond the stars. I hope you enjoy uncovering everything the universe has been waiting to reveal. Your feedback and support have helped shape Project Chromata, and I am deeply grateful to everyone who has joined the journey.</p>",
        "short_description": "Project Chromata is a A sci-fi incremental in ten stages that refuses to stay one. Pull red, yellow and blue out of the void, converge them into Light, and relight a dead universe. Then it changes. An idle game with an ending, not one prestige layer remains the same forever.",
